# UNDERDELVE: the Old Lode lies shut in its nest, harmless, until Mo strikes
# it. Then the door slams and the fight begins. It takes 8 hits, and only
# while it sits on the floor after a slam. Beating it opens the east wall;
# the Sunstone wins the game (Saucer), and with all six lanterns still lit,
# the Alien too. After the ending, A goes back to the library.
game underdelve
wait 15
cheat room 6 0 60 130
wait 5
expect boss_state == 6
expect sealed == 0
expect boss_hp == 8
hold RIGHT 60
expect lanterns == 6
press B
wait 20
expect boss_state == 4
expect sealed == 1
expect boss_hp == 8
hold LEFT 40
press B
wait 20
expect boss_hp == 8
cheat boss_ground
hold RIGHT 28
press B
wait 20
expect boss_hp == 7
cheat boss_hp 1
press B
wait 20
expect boss_state == 5
wait 160
expect boss_dead == 1
expect sealed == 0
hold RIGHT 220
expect room_x == 7
hold RIGHT 92
hold RIGHT+A 3
hold RIGHT 60
expect state == 5
expect goals & 2
expect goals & 4
wait 250
press A
wait 60
expect_scene library
